<title>USA: Textron gets $310 mln U.S. defense deal.</title>
<headline>Textron gets $310 mln U.S. defense deal.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, Nov 14 (Reuter ) Bell Helicopter Textron Inc, a unit of Textron Inc, has received a $300 million U.S. defense contract for the construction of three upgraded engineering development models of the AH-1W &quot;Super Cobra&quot; attack helicopter, the Pentagon said.</p>
</text>
